    "sections": {
        "description": "NewsPulse is a bold, image-first viral magazine theme. Build your homepage from ready-made sections: a big-story mosaic with a spinning Trending sticker and a numbered trending strip, a breaking news bar, most read cards, a swipeable must-read carousel, topic stickers, image tiles, a call-to-action block and widget areas. Every category gets its own tag color, and articles come with share buttons, a reading progress bar, an author box and related stories. Choose your accent color, fonts, rounded, sharp or square corners and a left or centered header with quick links. Includes light and dark mode, is keyboard-friendly, translation-ready and RTL-ready, and serves its fonts from your own site."
    },
